# Terrain Studio uses built-in procedural terrain only (topographic 0.3.0).
# No API keys are required for the current pin.
#
# Newer topographic releases (≥0.6) add built-in real places (Fuji, Grand Canyon, …)
# without a paid key. After bunfig.toml minimumReleaseAge allows those versions,
# bump topographic / topographic-react in package.json and pass `location: 'fuji'`
# (or other ids from the library docs) instead of procedural shapes.
